# The Barrens & Stonetalon Mountain (15-21): the Crossroads and the north and middle of the Barrens
# (the Razormane, the Witchwing harpies, the Kolkar of the oases, Vrang Wildgore and his hermit, the
# Venture Co. sites of the north), Ratchet and its pirates and Northwatch Hold, Camp Taurajo's first
# errands, two trips into Stonetalon Mountains (the Grimtotem camps and Kaya, Malaka'jin, the
# Deepmoss spiders, Sun Rock Retreat, Boulderslide Ravine, Windshear Crag), and the visits to
# Orgrimmar and Thunder Bluff these quests send you on, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/the_barrens_stonetalon_mountain_15_21.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites, race and class masks, drops, timers
# and the places of mobs and objects from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against
# outof.games (The Barrens, area 17; Stonetalon Mountains, area 406; Orgrimmar; Thunder Bluff);
# Zygor's route as a check (there is no RestedXP route below level 21). Wowhead refused the
# requests (403), so its comments were not read: the research is partial.
# The quest list is section 5 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md.
#
# Starts in Orgrimmar, off the zeppelin from Undercity: Silverpine Forest (13-15) should end at the
#   zeppelin tower outside Orgrimmar. From there the guide walks south through Durotar to Razor Hill
#   and west over the bridge into the Barrens.
# Carried in (skipped by those who lack it):
# - Sample for Helbrim (1358, Apothecary Zinge in Undercity, after Zinge's Delivery 1359):
#   Silverpine Forest (13-15) should take it on its way through Undercity.
# Left to later guides:
# - The Elder Crone (1063, Seereth Stonebreak), Trouble in the Deeps (6562, Tsunaman at Sun Rock
#   Retreat) and, for warlocks, Ken'zigla's Draught (1511, Ken'zigla at Malaka'jin): Ashenvale (21-22)
#   hands them in.
# - Until Death Do Us Part (264, Clarice Foster in Thunder Bluff) and Mura Runetotem (3301, Tonga
#   Runetotem at the Crossroads): Hillsbrad Foothills (22-24) hands them in.
# - for shamans, Call of Water (1536, Brine): Hillsbrad Foothills (22-24) fills its waterskin and
#   The Barrens (24-25) hands it in.
# Report to Kadrak (6542, Darn Talongrip at Malaka'jin) is done here; it is exclusive with the other
#   Report to Kadrak (6541) that The Barrens (24-25) offers, so that one skips itself.
# Left out:
# - The Warsong Reports (6543, Kadrak): its three Warsong scouts are in Ashenvale (Zoram'gar Outpost
#   on the west coast, south of Splintertree Post, the road to Azshara), and this guide never goes
#   there; none of the later guides takes it either.
# - Battle of Warsong Gulch (8368): a battleground quest (marks of honor from Warsong Gulch).
# - ... and that note you found (79007): it starts at the Burned-Out Remains in the far south of the
#   Barrens and ends at their twin in Westfall, an Alliance zone no Horde guide visits.
# - Regthar Deathgate (1361), Nazgrel's or Belgrom's letter for Regthar: level 32 (it needs level 30),
#   so it cannot be taken here, and its follow-up needs level 30 too.
# Race-only quests: The Shattered Hand (1963, 1858) is for Orc and Troll rogues (the builder reads the
#   race masks); Ken'zigla's Draught (1511) is said to be Orc and Undead only: the tip says so.
# The auction house: none of this guide's quest items is worth buying (the only one sold, the Blood
#   Shard, drops from every quilboar you kill anyway), so there is no AH stop.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar; Razor Hill and Far Watch; the Crossroads; the Razormane camps north-east of
# it; Ratchet and the Southsea pirates; the west and north of the Barrens (the Forgotten Pools,
# Barak, the harpies, Vrang Wildgore and Walton, the Samophlange); Ratchet again, then the far north
# (Echeyakee, Wenikee and the drill site); Orgrimmar; Ratchet and a loop south and west (the pirates
# again, the raptors, the Stagnant Oasis, Mankrik's wife) to Camp Taurajo; the Crossroads, Serena
# Bloodfeather and the first trip into Stonetalon (the Grimtotem, Malaka'jin, the spiders, Sun Rock
# Retreat, Boulderslide Ravine, Windshear Crag); the hearthstone to Camp Taurajo and its quilboars;
# the Lushwater Oasis and Regthar's counterattack; the north-east (Ishamuhale, Chol'aruk, the Boulder
# Lode Mine, Kadrak); Orgrimmar at level 20; Ratchet and Northwatch Hold; Thunder Bluff; Camp Taurajo
# and Jorn's last hunts; and the last trip into Stonetalon, which ends at the mouth of the Talondeep
# Path, where Ashenvale (21-22) starts.

guide The Barrens & Stonetalon Mountain (15-21)
faction horde
levels 15 21
carry 1358 93739 98024
leave 264 1063 1511 1536 3301 6562 93739
next Ashenvale (21-22)

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
goto "Off the zeppelin from Undercity, walk into Orgrimmar by its front gate" at 49.5,93.0 r 15
accept 1061
tip Zor Lonetree stands in the Valley of Wisdom, in the west of the city.
accept 809
tip Neeru Fireblade is in his tent in the Cleft of Shadow. He offers it to those who brought him Margoz's message in Durotar: if he doesn't, the step skips itself.
accept 1963
tip Rogues only, and only Orc and Troll rogues: Therzok is in a tent in the Cleft of Shadow.

# Razor Hill and Far Watch ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Durotar
accept 840
tip Takrin Pathseeker stands by the road in Razor Hill: leave Orgrimmar by the front gate and follow the road south.
map The Barrens
turnin 840
tip From Razor Hill take the road west over the bridge: Far Watch Post is the first Horde camp in the Barrens.
accept 842
do 809 at 62.3,20.1 icon talk "Talk to Ak'Zeloth, the demon hunter's spirit at Far Watch Post"
turnin 809
accept 924
do 924 at 48.0,19.1
tip Pick up a Flawed Power Stone from the table beside Ak'Zeloth: it crumbles after 30 minutes. Ride west along the road, then climb Dreadmist Peak from its north side and use the stone at the Altar of Fire on top. Each of you needs your own stone.

