accept 819 at 55.7,27.3 icon get "Look for Chen's Empty Keg on the ground and click it: it starts a quest"
tip The keg appears at one of several spots: by the Razormane camp east of the road, near Echeyakee's lair, at the Lushwater and Stagnant oases... If it isn't here, look again as you pass the other spots. If it vanishes once one of you has clicked it, wait for it to come back for the other.
do 871
tip The Razormane camps lie a short way north-east of the Crossroads, on both sides of the road. The Thornweavers cast entangling roots: kill them first.
